<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 6 December <span class="n">7</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/afonso-i-of-portugal"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/afonso-i-of-portugal.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Afonso I of Portugal</span><span class="tp">c. 1109–1185</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/pope-clement-vi"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/pope-clement-vi.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Pope Clement VI</span><span class="tp">1291–1352</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/jefferson-davis"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/jefferson-davis.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Jefferson Davis</span><span class="tp">1808–1889</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/b-r-ambedkar"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/b-r-ambedkar.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">B. R. Ambedkar</span><span class="tp">1891–1956</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/frantz-fanon"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Frantz Fanon</span><span class="tp">1925–1961</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/joao-goulart"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/joao-goulart.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">João Goulart</span><span class="tp">1919–1976</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/tunku-abdul-rahman"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/tunku-abdul-rahman.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Tunku Abdul Rahman</span><span class="tp">1903–1990</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
